  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Journalists&apos; Association - Human Rights and Independent Media</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective of this project proposal is to support young independent freelance journalists working for pluralistic, independent media and free press at the local and national level in protection and promotion of democracy, human rights, freedom of expression, freedom of press and advocacy for disadvantaged groups. Target group of the project is 90 young journalists below 35 years old.</narrative>
  </description>
